.TH GENBANK 4 2000-1月 "as.genbank" "as.genbank"
.SH NAME
as.genbank \- converts tabular data file to genbank assembly object
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIas.genbank(\fBx\fR as any, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
converts tabular data file to genbank assembly object
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBx\fB \fR\- 
 the tabular data object for convert as the genbank assembly object. 
 Only the [PTT](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Assembly.NCBI.GenBank.TabularFormat.PTT) tabular table object is supported at this 
 moment.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- the R# runtime environment object.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a [File](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Assembly.NCBI.GenBank.GBFF.File) ncbi genbank assembly object that converted 
 from the given tabular data;
 
 this function returns a R# error message object if the given tabular 
 data type is not supported.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
GenBank
.SH FILES
.PP
seqtoolkit.dll
.PP
